      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The advisory concerns torch.ops.profiler._call_end_callbacks_on_jit_fut. No training code calls the PyTorch profiler or the TorchScript future callbacks: neither torch.profiler nor torch.jit appears in ai/ or tools/ensemble-training-kit/ (scripts/ci/check-torch-scope.py keeps torch out of every other package). The OSV record lists torch up to 2.6.0-cu124 as affected and names no fixed release; the locks pin torch 2.14.1."
    },
