      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The advisory concerns the eager-mode quantized Sigmoid module (torch.ao.nn.quantized). The training packages never build eager-quantized modules: post-training quantization runs in ONNX Runtime on the exported graph (ai/src/vmaf_train/quantize.py) and QAT uses torchao's pt2e flow. The OSV record lists torch up to 2.6.0-cu124 as affected and names no fixed release; the locks pin torch 2.14.1."
    },
