      "justification": "vulnerable_code_cannot_be_controlled_by_adversary",
      "impact_statement": "The advisory concerns torch.jit.script on crafted input. The training packages never script code (no torch.jit call in ai/ or tools/ensemble-training-kit/), and ONNX export goes through torch.export (vmaf_train.models.exports). Whatever a dependency scripts at import is its own shipped code, not input an adversary supplies. The OSV record lists torch up to 2.6.0-NA as affected and names no fixed release; the locks pin torch 2.14.1."
